 screen:'M6 3h12a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v8a3 3 0 0 1-3 3H6a3 3 0 0 1-3-3V6a3 3 0 0 1 3-3 M8 21h8 M12 17v4 M8.5 10l3-3a.7.7 0 0 1 1 0l3 3 M12 7v7',
